{"id":"657362","name":"甑子蒸饭","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/657362/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"大米","amount":"300g"}],"sub":[{"name":"清水","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"大米淘洗干净。","img":"images/657362/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"水开入锅煮5分钟，用锅铲不停搅动，防止粘锅。","img":"images/657362/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"用手沾上一粒米，能压扁即可。","img":"images/657362/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"开始沥米，水尽量沥干。","img":"images/657362/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入盆内，用筷子扒松。","img":"images/657362/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"把米饭倒入甑子里。","img":"images/657362/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"用筷子插几个孔，容易透气。","img":"images/657362/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入锅内蒸20分钟即可。","img":"images/657362/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"时间到，一股木香味的大米饭。","img":"images/657362/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"蒸出的米饭散疏不夹生，自带木桶的清香，低糖又健康。","img":"images/657362/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：其他\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}